  "Id": "a31926dd-defb-5980-9e21-f16e77cd0a56"/*PhysicsSeesawExample*/,
  "Description": "A heavy crate drops onto a seesaw and launches the crate on its other end.\n\nThe plank is hinged to a kinematic pivot with a hinge [RigidJoint] around the Z axis. It starts tilted, with the small crate resting on its low end.\n\nAKA: hinge, lever, catapult\n\nTips\n- The hinge point sits below the plank so the joint partners do not overlap.\n- HingeAxisA and HingeAxisB are given in the local space of each body.",
